  "notes": "USAGE:\n{防御|ぼうぎょ} focuses on the active act of defending — blocking or repelling an attack. It is used in military, sports, gaming, and cybersecurity contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {防御|ぼうぎょ}する (to defend)\n- {防御|ぼうぎょ}{力|りょく} (defensive power/ability)\n- {防御|ぼうぎょ}{体制|たいせい} (defense posture/system)\n- {防御|ぼうぎょ}{線|せん} (line of defense)\n- {防御|ぼうぎょ}{率|りつ} (defensive rate — in baseball)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {防御|ぼうぎょ}: defense (actively blocking or repelling attacks)\n- {防衛|ぼうえい}: defense (protecting territory or sovereignty; {自衛隊|じえいたい} uses {防衛|ぼうえい})\n- {守備|しゅび}: defense (sports positioning and fielding)\n- {防護|ぼうご}: protection (shielding from harm, often physical barriers)",
